                        "description_en": "The network type of the endpoint. Valid values:\n\nPublic: An endpoint for the Internet.\n\nPrivate: A private endpoint.\n\nInner: A private endpoint in a classic network",
                        "description_zh": "连接串网络类型，取值范围如下：\nPublic：公网地址\nPrivate：私网地址\nInner：私网地址（经典网络）",
                        "example": "Private",
                        "nullToEmpty": false,
                        "type": "string",
